#: SELF
msgid "self"
msgstr ""

# null (!!when last translated was: The "same" roleclass asserts an identity between playing and scoping entities: that they are in fact instances of the same entity and, in the case of discrepancies (e.g different DOB, gender), that one or both are in error.)
#: SELF@definition
